Z||000002||afRaceR||12-12-2000||07:03 PM||||Look in the newspaper and Thrifty Nickel for people that are selling whole cars with a 3.4. Sometimes people will sell a car for $300-400 just to get rid of it. Pull the motor out of it and whatever else you want and either put your 2.8 in it or just keep the motor and sell the car to a junk yard. You could probably get more of your money back if it has somekind of motor in it. Just be sure you get a title for it.||||reg||1
